# SwiftPM's build directory, which holds a full git CHECKOUT of every dependency - two dozen of them
# for this module. Nothing ignored it until 2026-08-22, so a `swift build` here followed by a
# `git add -A` stages 1,100+ vendored files and git warns about "embedded git repositories" rather
# than refusing. It only stayed invisible because Swift builds in a container on CI and most
# developers never build it natively at all.
.build/
